window.products.push({"id":793274,"name":"Rae Dunn Bathroom Containers for Organizing - Storage Canister Set of 3 with Lids and Wood Tray - Home Decor, Bathroom Vanity Organizer, Toilet Tank T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xHIjcscFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breathe style and life into your boring bathroom with this exquisite Set of 3 Canisters and Tray from Rae Dunn . Keep toiletries and bathroom accessories organized in an easy-to-access location with these three jars that say “One”, “Two” and “Three” in Rae Dunn’s signature font. PRODUCT FEATURES: Set of 3 White Canisters with LidsDark Brown Wooden Organizer TrayHigh Quality CraftsmanshipHome, Office and Bathroom Décor Dimensions of canisters – 4” x 3” x 3”Dimensions overall – 10” x 4.5” x 3.5” ORGANIZE IN STYLE Don’t spend one more second without this essential bathroom and vanity storage canister set! Wooden lids beautifully complement the white ceramic. Place by the sink or on top of the toilet tank to quickly reach everyday items. Perfect for storing cotton balls, Q-tips, bath salts, bath bombs, makeup sponges, bobby pins, hair ties, hair clips and more. Go beyond the washroom and bring a modern farmhouse storage solution to any room or surface of the home including the bedroom, nursery, dresser top, kitchen countertop, bookshelf, nightstand or end table. Use for office essentials like paper clips, staples, post-it notes, pushpins and stamps. RAE DUNN California artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn , finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. “In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.” Rae’s designs are known for their functionality, design and durability. Rae’s signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xHIjcscFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B08L5K41DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L5K41DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L5K41DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
