window.products.push({"id":793645,"name":"Dri-Eaz F284 DefendAir HEPA 500 Air Purifier Negative Air Machine Air Scrubber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJN2y4xAL._SL1446_.jpg","description":"Dri-Eaz The DefendAir HEPA 500 uses HEPA filter media with an efficiency rating of 99.97% against 0.3-micron oily aerosol particles. When used with the optional DOP 2nd stage filter, the HEPA 500 provides assurances for first-pass filtration. The optional Activated Carbon Filter allows users to quickly and effectively attack smoke and other noxious odors in the environment. With user-friendly and versatile features, the HEPA 500 is ideal for handling indoor air quality needs on every restoration job. Any job that involves sewage, mold, or fire damage clearly involves significant amounts of particulates and smelly gasses a direct result of the damage itself. In a water damage restoration environment, the high-velocity airflow needed for drying can stir up particulates that have settled in carpet or on other materials. The HEPA 500 can address indoor air quality quickly and efficiently, and help restore any environment to a pre-loss condition the ultimate goal of every restoration job. Frequency: 60 Hz. Filter system: 2-stage. GFCI: Outlet protected. Power cord length: 25-feet. Safety marks: UL/C-UL Listed. Advanced filtration technology. Daisy chain capability link up to 3 units on 1 power outlet. Variable CFM on each unit up to 1500 CFM per 15-amp circuit. Stackable, lightweight, and easily transportable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJN2y4xAL._SL1446_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dri-Eaz","source_asin":"B00AB25016","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AB25016","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AB25016","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":793646,"name":"AOZITA Aozita15 PACK Glass Mason Jars 12 oz, Regular Mouth Canning Jars with Metal Airtight Lids, Leak-Proof Colored Lids, Chalkboard Labels, Marker, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mL2fzDy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12oz MASON JARS SET INCLUDES: 15 glass mason jars, 15 metal separable airtight lids, 15 colorful lids with silicone sealing rings, 20 writable stickers and a white marker. Each jar is 4 4/5 inches in height, 2 3/4 inches in mouth’s width, and 32oz (355ml) in capacity. PREMIUM GLASS AND AIRTIGHT LIDS: The jars are made of superior food-grade glass, healthy, lead-free and dishwasher safe. The metal lid is lined with a BPA-free sealable plastisol. The colorful plastic lids can be used with or without the leak-proof silicone ring. The blank label stickers can be written in white (chalk marks included), which gives you the option of placing labels on the side of the jar or on the lid. VISIBLE, SEALABLE, CLASSIFIABLE DESIGN: High transparency glass designs to be really visible to see what’s inside when piled up with many jars. The split metal cover is specially designed for fermentation with excellent airtightness. Plastic lids come with silicone rings for enhanced tightness are available in four colors for better classification or you can directly mark the categories on the label. CAN STORE WITH MANY KINDS: The proper capacity and wide opening of the jar is ideal for storing diverse of fruits and vegetables or any other stuff you may want to place in it like homemade pickles, tomatoes, sauerkraut, salmon, smoked mackerel and pumpkins, also great for grains, candy, jam, kidney beans, olive, peppers, fusilli, gravy and preserves, etc. MULTIPURPOSE IN MANY OCCASIONS: It has many uses in fermentation, canning and storage in everyday homes and kitchens, and also for placing some ready-to-eat foods that need to be opened frequently, even can be used for dry or liquid storage in restaurant and warehouse freezers and refrigerators, very versatile and essential.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mL2fzDy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOZITA","source_asin":"B08PB7TLFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PB7TLFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PB7TLFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
