window.products.push({"id":793735,"name":"VEVOR Electric Cotton Candy Machine, 19.7-inch Stainless Steel Bowl, 1050W Candy Floss Maker with 338-482℉ Adjustable Temperature, Cover and Sugar Sco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N22yQ1VyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet Your Commercial Needs: Our commercial cotton candy machine adopts a 1050W motor, which only requires 2-minute preheat time, ensuring rapid cotton candy cones production; The spinning head, with 5000RPM rotating speed, can store 0.5 oz / 15g sugar at one time and product 120 cotton candy cones per hour, satisfying your large output demands. Digital Temp Control: Unlike the common ones, our electric candy floss maker features a digital voltage display screen and a temp control knob. By changing voltage from 0V to 110V precisely, you can simply adjust the temperature from 338℉ to 482℉. If you want to try different flavored sugars, you will absolutely need this. Reliable Structure with Floss Bubble: Our cotton candy maker comprises the carbon steel body and 19.7-inch stainless steel bowl, providing rust and corrosion resistance. With the premium material, it can withstand harsh tasks with high requirements. The transparent top cover can effectively avoid dirty objects from entering. In addition, it is designed with locking clips, allowing you to detach the bowl to clean effortlessly and reducing the vibration at work for low noise and stability. User-Friendly Designs: This candy floss maker is equipped with a candy box, which helps provide extra storage space for cotton candy cones/sticks or floss sugar packs; The vent holes on two sides are well-designed for heat-dissipation, ensuring the reliability of the motor in the long-term use; The bottom feet are nonslip for the stability of this machine. Besides, a sugar spoon as an extra offering is convenient for you to scoop and pour sugar. Work with Any Candy You Like: This cotton machine allows you to use flossing sugars, milk sugars, fruit cubes, or hard candies to make delicious cotton candies. With a compact size, it is suitable for countertop use, and it is perfect for carnivals, festivals, birthday parties, and sports events. Friendly Note: The cotton candy machine and cover may be in different packages and be delivered separately. Please do not worry, you will receive ALL the parcels in recent days after the order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N22yQ1VyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0B1Q8KT2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Q8KT2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Q8KT2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
