window.products.push({"id":793767,"name":"STEAM VAC SUPREME Hoover F6027-980 SteamVac WidePath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CHQ9WTFDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com This 950-watt, two-speed, hot-water vacuum cleans carpets deeply and scrubs bare floors with six rotating brushes that cover a 14-inch path illuminated by dual headlights. With onboard attachments connected to a 10-foot hose, the vacuum accomplishes other chores as well. A power tool brushes upholstery and stairs clean, and there are other tools for bare floors and crevices. The vacuum applies hot tap water and cleaning solution (one 16-ounce bottle is included) and then vacuums up the dirty water. Both clean-water and dirty-water tanks detach. A finger trigger applies cleaning mixture as needed, and a thumb-activated button boosts the mixture's output by 50 percent for heavy soil. Made of plastic, the vacuum weighs 28 pounds, stands 45 inches high, has a toe-operated on/off switch, and comes with a 27-foot power cord. Assembly requires just two screws (which are included). Hoover warranties the vacuum against defects for one year. --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer SpinScrub six removable rotating brushes SpinScrub six removable rotating brushes Clean Surge button Clean Surge button Includes powered hand tool Includes powered hand tool 30-foot cord with quick release 30-foot cord with quick release Bare floor tool storage Bare floor tool storage Toe-operated on/off switch and handle release Toe-operated on/off switch and handle release Cleaning mode indicator Cleaning mode indicator Brush speed selector Brush speed selector Edge pickers Edge pickers 14-inch cleaning path 14-inch cleaning path Includes one 16-ounce carpet/upholstery detergent Includes one 16-ounce carpet/upholstery detergent Full one-year warranty Full one-year warranty Deep cleans carpet fibers by applying hot tap water and cleaning solution Deep cleans carpet fibers by applying hot tap water and cleaning solution","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CHQ9WTFDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STEAM VAC SUPREME","source_asin":"B00005R17X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005R17X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005R17X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
