window.products.push({"id":793819,"name":"Tree-Free Greetings Extra Large 20-Ounce Ceramic Coffee Mug, Aunty Acid Nice To Secretary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r1SOIUUCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Living sustainably means realizing that small choices can have a big impact on our environment. Printed and assembled in the USA, the Tree-Free Greetings Extra Large 20-Ounce Ceramic Coffee Mug is vibrantly printed with hard to find Nice To Secretary themed art, and is great for everyday use. This mug is printed with VOC-free, solvent-free water-based dye and will stay vibrant for the life of the product. The mug is reusable, therefore eliminating any disposable paper or Styrofoam cup waste. BPA free and Proposition 65 compliant, this beautiful, generously sized mug will become an instant favorite. AND it's dishwasher and microwave safe. The Extra Large 20-Ounce Ceramic Coffee Mug makes the perfect gift or souvenir. Save trees and spread joy, buy a Tree-Free gift today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r1SOIUUCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tree-Free Greetings","source_asin":"B01GJEQ6GM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GJEQ6GM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GJEQ6GM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":793820,"name":"Large Gold Plastic Food Serving Bowl - 10pk. Reusable Decorative Rectangular Appetizer Tray - Elegant Modern Weaved Design for Kitchen, Party, Centerp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UspxhiZkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Get a value pack of serving trays, bowls, and baskets for any event! The massive 10 Pack Reusable Serving Trays, Bowls, and Baskets from Impressive Creations are beautifully decorative, affordable and durable. As the perfect home accent, it’s decorative and multi-functional. They're perfectly versatile so you can serve anything from appetizers, breads, candy, snacks, full meals, dessert - you name it! Whether you’re using them for function or décor our bowls, plates, trays and serving dishes won’t break, crack or shatter. Show off your sense of style and luxury without going over your budget. Add a touch of magic to your home or party with Impressive Creations. PRODUCT FEATURES: Made From Premium Quality Plastic Heavy-Duty Material Eye-Catching Design High-Quality Materials Makes Them Durable Holds Just About Anything Doesn’t Crack, Break or Shatter Looks Beautiful Perfect for Parties or Daily Use Great for Weddings, Holidays, Parties and Other Special Occasions Easy to Clean Available Colors: Gold, Rose Gold and Silver IMPRESS YOUR GUESTS! These versatile trays are decorative and perfect for decorating. Make special occasions a delight with the help of our standout décor designs. Use them to create beautiful centerpieces for your dining table, coffee table, foyer or kitchen counter. Add seasonal accessories like flowers, potpourri or candles to make something magical. Use it as a utensil holder to store and display flatware. Not only is our tableware great for celebrations they’re also great for daily use. Set yours in the entryway and use it to store your daily essentials like your keys, wallet and pocket change. Go for the gold, silver or bronze and choose the perfect color finish for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UspxhiZkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMPRESSIVE CREATIONS","source_asin":"B09L1FQHZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L1FQHZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L1FQHZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
