window.products.push({"id":793842,"name":"Laguiole Ambiance 6 large spoons, trendy multicolors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qQwxPBCTL._AC_.jpg","description":"These 6 Laguiole large Ambiance spoons - vibrant colors - are presented in their cardboard box set with display cover. ABS handle ABS handle 2 stainless steel bolsters and rivets 2 stainless steel bolsters and rivets Multicolor handles: vibrant colors (yellow, blue, grenadine, green, orange, purple) Multicolor handles: vibrant colors (yellow, blue, grenadine, green, orange, purple) large spoons length: 22 cm large spoons length: 22 cm Cardboard presentation box Cardboard presentation box This range is designed for everyday use, with a dishwasher-friendly guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qQwxPBCTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAGUIOLE","source_asin":"B00967W7D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00967W7D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00967W7D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":793843,"name":"WIOR 6-Blade Wood Stove Fan Heated Powered Fireplace Fan, Ultra Quiet Non Electric Stove Eco Fan for Home Gas/Pellet/Wood/Log Burner Stove, Eco Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cl7JS4sCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded 6-Blade Stove Fan】Widely used for wood burning stoves, gas stoves, pellet stoves, log burners, fireplaces, etc. Our wood stove fan is equipped with 6 blades that can provide larger volumes, diverting the warm air horizontally all around your house rather than going straight up to the ceil. And it is made from premium anodized aluminum, which is rust-proof and shows excellent thermal conductivity and heat resistance, and will not deform even after long term work under high temperatures. 【Heat Powered & Non Electric】No batteries or electricity required. The 6-blade wood stove fan is powered by heat from the fireplace or wood burning stove and is conducted through the base of the fan to the thermoelectric module that acts as a small generator to power the fan's motor to drive the blades. It allows you to get the maximum heat from your stove, and also promotes warm air circulation while reducing wood consumption. 【Overheating Protection】The eco-friendly wood burning stove fan comes with a bi-metallic safety device at the bottom, which will gently lift the front of the fan from the stove surface when the temperature of the stove surface exceeds 300℃/572℉, so as to protect the thermoelectric module and motor from damage. And as the surface temperature of the fireplace decreases, it will automatically return to normal. 【Operating Temperature】The optimum operating temparature of this fireplace fan is 80°C - 350°C(176°F - 662°F). Usually the motor will drive the blades to spin when the thermoelectric module detects a minimum temperature of 50℃(122℉). The hotter the stove is, the faster the blades spin. When the temperature reaches about 250°C to 300°C, the fan works most efficiently. And the motor may be damaged, once the temperature exceeds 350°C. 【Easy & Ultra Quiet Operation】No assembly required. Just place the heat powered stove fan on a smooth flat surface of your stove top (allowing about 15cm of space behind the fan), the stove fan will automatically rotate as the temperature getting higher and spread heat around the room. The blades assembly is the only moving part of the fan, and will produce noise as low as 25 decibels, giving you an ultra quiet atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cl7JS4sCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WIOR","source_asin":"B0BDFPZVJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-793843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFPZVJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFPZVJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
